{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/reactorserve(config:transport:handler:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reactorServe","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"config","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReactorConfig","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ReactorConfig","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13ReactorConfigV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transport","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReactorTransport","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ReactorTransport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16ReactorTransportP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handler","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReactorEvent","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ReactorEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12ReactorEventV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReactorAnswer","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ReactorAnswer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13ReactorAnswera"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For each delivery, in this order (§22.3): refuse "},{"code":"key_version","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" below 2; verify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","t